  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Apoyo al Programa Nacional de Desarrollo del Turismo (PRODETUR Nacional)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for the National Tourism Development Program (PRODETUR Nacional)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo de la operacin es garantizar que los prestatarios elegibles bajo la lnea de crdito cuentan con los recursos y la informacin necesarios para la preparacin de sus operaciones, en concordancia con las directrices de la poltica nacional (Plan Nacional de Turismo, 2007-2010).</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of the operation is to guarantee that the eligible borrowers under the credit line rely on the resources and information required for the preparation of their operations, in conformity with the guidelines of the national tourism policy (National Plan of Tourism, 2007-2010).</narrative>
  </description>
